WEBVTT

00:00.250 --> 00:03.970
Localhost three thousand. Four thousand. Which port?

00:04.050 --> 00:11.730
devhost puts your local app on HTTPS hostnames, through a managed Caddy. For when logins and cookies need more than a port.

00:11.800 --> 00:18.490
List your services in one file. Then one command: devhost start. Routes open when health checks pass.

00:18.600 --> 00:22.790
Optional devtools add real-time logs and service controls, right in the page.

00:23.050 --> 00:25.640
TanStack Query devtools are one click away.

00:26.000 --> 00:30.780
Hold Alt, click an element, describe the change. A coding agent edits your source.

00:31.100 --> 00:32.740
And the page hot-reloads.

00:33.300 --> 00:36.720
devhost. Open source, on GitHub. Stop juggling ports.
